## Kubernetes (Offerfy)

Namespace: **`offerfy-native-tmp`**.

| Object | Role |
|---|---|
| Service `offerfy-native-3100` | ClusterIP port **3200** (name is leftover from the 3100 era) |
| Endpoints `offerfy-native-3100` | **`192.168.49.1:3200`** (minikube → host Next). Manual Endpoints; no selector |
| Ingress `offerfy-native` | class `nginx`; hosts below; `ssl-redirect: true`; body 15m; proxy timeouts 3600 |
| Certificate `offerfy-cc-tls` | `offerfy.cc` + `www.offerfy.cc` → secret `offerfy-cc-tls` |
| Certificate `test-lu-im-ntu-edu-tw` | Ready → secret `test-lu-im-ntu-edu-tw-tls` |
| Certificate `test-lu-im-ntu-edu-tw-tls` | **False** (ingress-shim duplicate on same secret). Harmless if `test-lu-im-ntu-edu-tw` stays Ready. Do not point two Certificates at one secret |

Annotations on Ingress: `cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer: letsencrypt-prod`.

### Recreate (idempotent)

